{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在節目《美食新聞報道》中，飲食廚藝文化專家劉惠平與伍倩彤（Gillian），聯同主持蔡景行（行仔）與波波（黃婧靈），帶領觀眾展開一場法式創意菜與超濃郁日式拉麵的美食之旅。</p><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><p style=\"text-align: left;\">率先登場的頭盤是「吞拿魚腩刺身」，嚴選油脂極其豐盈的頂級大拖羅，粉嫩的魚肉上交織著雪花般的油脂。大廚特別搭配香氣濃郁的燒茄子蓉，再淋上特製魚香油醋汁，酸香微辣的調味恰到好處地中和了拖羅的濃厚脂香，令口感入口即化且清新爽口。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">緊接著是「北海道大帶子」，以橄欖油低溫慢煮至精緻的半熟狀態，完美鎖住水分與幼嫩口感。配搭香氣四溢的蔥油與特製油封大蒜乳酪醬，再點綴晶瑩剔透的魚籽，將海鮮的極致鮮甜提升至另一層次。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">第三道是減肥人士不容錯過的「香煎墨魚闊條麵」。「麵條」特別採用鮮爽墨魚製作，幾乎達到零碳水，搭配香濃的港式咖哩汁並以清香芫荽苗點綴，再串上香煎墨魚串，完美融合多國菜元素，一舉打破意式海鮮麵的傳統框架。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">壓軸登場的是「海膽煲仔意大利飯」，巧妙地將法式 Risotto 與港式煲仔飯意念結合。米粒吸飽美味高湯，混入甘甜濃郁的頂級海膽與肥美阿拉斯加鱈場蟹肉，出鍋前撒上氣炸銀魚仔與炸薑蓉點綴，每一口都帶來酥脆與綿密交織的豐富口感，鮮香四溢。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Maison ES</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"42bcaa01-8edb-4975-8521-1dda3eb63578.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026UGzExh2puM1787712226.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"42bcaa01-8edb-4975-8521-1dda3eb63578.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4765ef5c-b816-4c2d-84bc-26001871a471.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/20260JR3ezGubn1787712225.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4765ef5c-b816-4c2d-84bc-26001871a471.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0c18e175-4f65-41b5-80a1-387e01940df3.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026zw8kyDy3N81787712226.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0c18e175-4f65-41b5-80a1-387e01940df3.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"34c903ed-15c1-443c-b08a-75781c903882.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026y4pRhfh3Fu1787712226.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"34c903ed-15c1-443c-b08a-75781c903882.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">隨後由蔡景行與波波黃婧靈接棒，帶大家品嚐一間深得影帝張家輝喜愛的日式拉麵店。店內首推的「煮干醬油拉麵」採用多加水熟成麵，麵條口感極其絲滑順口，能完美吸附濃郁湯汁。湯底融合了鮮美雞香與魚乾風味，醬油鹹甜適中、層次分明，碗內更一次過鋪上嫩滑雞肉與豬肉，讓人大呼過癮。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">另一款「W豚雞白湯拉麵」則選用低加水全麥拉麵，咬勁十足且咀嚼間散發出濃郁的小麥香氣。其精華湯底以豚骨、雞骨加上大量鮮美貝類精心熬製，奶白色的湯底無比濃郁順滑，掛汁力極佳。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">除了拉麵外，店內的特色小食同樣驚豔。「御好燒風味餃子」是經典日式煎餃的創意變身，外皮煎至金黃酥脆，淋上特製醬汁與沙律醬並鋪滿木魚花，滋味猶如品嚐章魚小丸子，層次相當豐富。最後的「天婦羅魷魚」將魷魚炸至外酥內軟，金黃麵衣特別調入紫菜香氣，一口咬下外皮香脆得像在吃紫菜薯片一樣卡滋作響，裡面的魷魚依然保持彈牙多汁，絕對是令人停不下來的邪惡小食。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">泓一拉麵</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li></ul><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"80d9406f-2488-4a20-b40d-4c423db71176.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026FbNgjMCRc61787712226.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"80d9406f-2488-4a20-b40d-4c423db71176.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9b4ca17b-9dab-40bf-80bc-17c76b95a862.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026XaDl0lziaf1787712226.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9b4ca17b-9dab-40bf-80bc-17c76b95a862.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"e397c26d-3400-4304-b4c8-e8af1b73b78f.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026x8wiVP3k4Q1787712226.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"e397c26d-3400-4304-b4c8-e8af1b73b78f.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"a4a67d56-1e19-4d22-af8c-bdd4643662b4.png.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/08/2026ktlJyhra7E1787712226.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"a4a67d56-1e19-4d22-af8c-bdd4643662b4.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-26T13:58:45.356711+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":909,"images":8,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}